  "methodological_findings": [
    "Original train/dev/calibration simultaneously change operator family and action-predicate vocabulary;existing failures alone do not identify which factor caused them.",
    "A definite partial or incomplete report is asserted,not a completed action. Keep commitment and completion outputs separate.",
    "Zero observed errors across96 authored negatives is not zero deployment risk;templates are correlated and are not96 independent user conversations.",
    "V13/V14 upper-tail probabilities exceed0.99;the original fixed grid can discard useful coverage. Preserve frozen outcomes and label continuous recalibration as retrospective diagnostic.",
    "The current classifier addresses one generic reference;it does not yet solve scope over multiple named actions or full recipe state.",
    "Train family not_denying has a pragmatic boundary:absence of denial need not entail a direct factual report. Flag for label review before training;do not silently relabel validation."
  ],
